  · change 14<0 at h; omega
  · change 14<1 at h; omega
  · change 14<2 at h; omega
  · change 14<3 at h; omega
  · change 14<4 at h; omega
  · change 14<5 at h; omega
  · change 14<6 at h; omega
  · change 14<7 at h; omega
  · change 14<8 at h; omega
  · change 14<9 at h; omega
  · change 14<10 at h; omega
  · change 14<11 at h; omega
  · change 14<12 at h; omega
  · change 14<13 at h; omega
  · change 14<14 at h; omega
  · exact c14_15
  · exact c14_16
  · exact c14_17
  · exact c14_18
  · exact c14_19
  · exact c14_20
  · exact c14_21
  · exact c14_22
  · exact c14_23
  · exact c14_24
